{"version": 2, "width": 106, "height": 18, "title": "CyberHutch — scripted walkthrough (no live scan)", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCyberHutch — scripted preview / no live scan\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m$ cyber doctor\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nOK    host prerequisites available\r\nWARN  VM stopped — not started by doctor\r\nINFO  optional tools stay optional\r\n      No installs. No model requests.\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCyberHutch — scripted preview / no live scan\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m$ cyber tools plan strix --json\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\"automatic_install\": false\r\n\"commands\": [engine, strix]\r\nKali and Shannon are not selected.\r\nInspect a plan before installing anything.\r\n"]
[10.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCyberHutch — scripted preview / no live scan\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m$ /model research\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSelected: research · example/research-model\r\nUse your own compatible API provider.\r\nSwitch models and resume sessions in the terminal.\r\n"]
[15.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCyberHutch — scripted preview / no live scan\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m$ cyber strix --model research -- --help\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nusage: strix [-h] [-v] ...\r\nOptional Strix CLI; configured API model reused for scans.\r\nHelp/version do not call the model.\r\n"]
[20.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCyberHutch — scripted preview / no live scan\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m$ cyber pull\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nCopy small deliverables to out/work/ when ready.\r\nLarge intermediate files stay in the guest.\r\nOpenCode + optional Kali, Strix and Shannon.\r\nYour models. Your workspace.\r\n"]
[25.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2mEnd of scripted preview.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
